exports[`resetPasswordTemplate > renders the full text body deterministically (snapshot) 1`] = `
"WARNING: Resetting your password will permanently delete all your bookmarks, tags, and thumbnails. This cannot be undone. Your data is encrypted with a key derived from your password — a new password creates an irrecoverable new key.

If you still wish to proceed, click the link below. The link expires in 1 hour.

https://example.test/api/email/reset-password?token=abcDEF123_-xyzQRS456

If you did not request a password reset, you can ignore this email — your account is safe."
`;
